    <briefdescription>
<para>Cumulative per-operation latency and throughput metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All latency fields are in <bold>microseconds</bold>. Counters are monotonically increasing from the moment the engine was last opened.</para>
<para><bold>Sentinel values for min latency fields:</bold> <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_storage_engine_1_1_i_o_metrics_1a2466e641d3f15029eafdd4f937e09dab" kindref="member">put_latency_min_us</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_storage_engine_1_1_i_o_metrics_1a11a995089569a3f82d91875a48339551" kindref="member">get_latency_min_us</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_storage_engine_1_1_i_o_metrics_1ae7292935775b5696ee878d668388ca15" kindref="member">del_latency_min_us</ref></computeroutput> are initialised to <computeroutput>UINT64_MAX</computeroutput> (no operations observed yet). Callers should check the corresponding <computeroutput>_ops</computeroutput> counter and treat <computeroutput>UINT64_MAX</computeroutput> as &quot;no data&quot;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
